==Description==
The '''Crimson Camo Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from General I rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Crimson Camo Nametag''' has text with a white to red gradient and a black outline. Red, white, grey and black camo background can be seen behind the text. An icon of the General rank can be seen next to the text.

